      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹8.16 (up from ₹5.56 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹36.9m (up 17% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹24.6m (up 47% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 67% (up from 53% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was primarily driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 58% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 28% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
